===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*stel-}}
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|locatio|locatio, locationis|a placing}}, from {{m|la|locare||to place, put, set, let}}, from {{m|la|locus||a place}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|locate|ion}}.

